        "h_title": "Genuine Island Hospitality at Sairee Beach",
        "main_title": "Coming Soon",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Great food and quick service. The mango smoothie was probably one of the freshest I’ve had and you can genuinely tell it was made with fresh mangoes. Pineapple fried rice was a hit. And the other food my friends got was amazing too.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Absolutely love this place. Superb location, great vibe & friendly, efficient staff.<br><br>The pizzas are great if you want a break from Thai food but for me, the chicken Khao Soi was the absolute winner. Everything we ordered was genuinely superb though.<br><br>We ate here 3 times in our 10 days on Koh Tao, kinda says it all!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "This restaurant has a wonderful atmosphere with a wide view of the beach. The food and drinks we ordered were delicious, and the smoothies were especially refreshing. The staff provided great service. For a beachfront restaurant with such a great vibe, we think the prices are actually quite reasonable—better than many similar places we've been to!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Excellent restaurant! We had their amazing grilled meat with 2 skewers, curry with tofu, papaya salad and pizza. Everything was just great. We will come again.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
